IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgca-transfers`

-- Strategic Goods (Control) Act 2002, ss 2, 5, 6, 7(5), 8(4), 9 to 12, 18, 20, 21(5), 30 to 32 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_strategic-goods-control-act-2002.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

