§ `s 2`

#ASSERT `the movement is controlled by section 5(1)(a)` `taking goods out of Singapore after they were landed here`
#ASSERT `the movement is controlled by section 5(1)(a)` `carrying goods through a Singapore port on the same ship without landing them`
#ASSERT NOT `the movement is controlled by section 5(1)(a)` `a foreign ship passing through Singapore waters without stopping`
#ASSERT NOT `the movement is controlled by section 5(1)(a)` `a foreign ship anchoring in Singapore only in distress`
#ASSERT NOT `the movement is controlled by section 5(1)(a)` `importing goods into Singapore`

