#ASSERT NOT `the transfer is an offence under section 5` `transmitting listed technology in the public domain`
#ASSERT NOT `the transfer is an offence under section 5` `emailing listed technology for a patent application`
#ASSERT NOT `the transfer is an offence under section 5` `uploading listed technology unaware it reached abroad`
